2283
01:54:52.494 --> 01:54:55.497
<i>But they’d laugh</i>
<i>at my dumb jokes</i> <i>and forgive me</i>

2284
01:54:55.671 --> 01:54:58.065
<i>when I was on the wrong part </i>
<i>of cold and calculating.</i>

2285
01:54:58.239 --> 01:55:00.284
<i>Or something.</i>
